 "remarks": "ATTENTION INVESTORS & CASH BUYERS! EXCEPTIONAL OPPORTUNITY IN DESIRABLE NORWALK! Discover the incredible potential of this spacious single-family home, ideal for multigenerational living! Situated on a desirable corner lot, this unique property boasts TWO OF ALMOST EVERYTHING! The main level features a spacious living room with a cozy fireplace, an open-concept dining area and kitchen, three generously sized bedrooms, a full bathroom complete with a bathtub and separate stand-up shower, and a convenient laundry closet. Beautiful hardwood floors throughout! The lower level offers an abundance of additional living space, featuring a spacious eat-in kitchen with a charming peek-through window overlooking the large living room, a bedroom, an additional bonus room, a full bathroom with tub, and a dedicated laundry room. DOUBLE THE FEATURES, DOUBLE THE POSSIBILITIES! Two washers, two dryers, two boilers, two hot water heaters, and three heating zones for added comfort and convenience! Additional highlights include gas heat, driveway parking for up to four vehicles, a fully fenced backyard, and a large deck perfect for outdoor entertaining and relaxation. A RARE OPPORTUNITY WITH TREMENDOUS POTENTIAL!",
